# Playwright MCP run output — created wherever the MCP runs (repo root or subdir)
.playwright-mcp/
# Playwright MCP browser profile when the MCP runs from the REPO ROOT (e.g. inside a git
# worktree), which puts it at /tooling/ instead of testAutomation_v1.0/tooling/. It holds a
# live logged-in Cambridge One session and must never be committed — this repo is public.
# The leading slash matters: it pins this to the repo root only, so the TRACKED design-time
# tooling at testAutomation_v1.0/tooling/ is unaffected.
/tooling/